--- well-formed ---
Success(R(abc, Array()))
Success(R(abc, Array()))
Success(R(say "hi", Array()))
Success(R(it's, Array()))
Success(R(a # b, Array()))
Success(R(v, Array()))
Success(R(it's, Array(x, y)))
--- malformed ---
Failure(yaml: unterminated quoted scalar "\"abc")
Failure(yaml: unterminated quoted scalar "'abc")
Failure(yaml: unexpected text after quoted scalar "\"abc\" trailing")
Failure(yaml: unexpected text after quoted scalar "'abc' trailing")
Failure(yaml: unterminated quoted scalar "\"abc\\\"")
Failure(yaml: unterminated quoted scalar "\"x")
Failure(yaml: unexpected text after quoted scalar "'x' 'y'")
